      "writtenOn": "2026-03-16T09:09:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For BMP not using `SkBmpRustCodec` would mean not supporting the embedded ICC color profile. While `BmpDecoder` from image crate supports handling the BMP from a ICO file, currently it is quite coupled with its own ico implementation. However I see that `pub fn read_metadata_in_ico_format(\u0026mut self) -\u003e ImageResult\u003c()\u003e` function is public, so maybe it can be used from rust_bmp FFI to expose handling of ico.",
      "parentUuid": "c4a226fe_1203d811",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 79,
        "startChar": 0,
